{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "e5f6a7b8-c9d0-1234-ef01-567890123456",
    "name": "Mentorix Backend",
    "description": "Коллекция сгенерирована по коду (`cmd/api`, `internal/auth`, `internal/admin`, `internal/exercise`, `internal/health`).\n\n## Environments\n- **Mentorix Local** — `http://localhost:8080`\n- **Mentorix Render Dev** — `https://mentorix-backend.onrender.com`\n\nВыбери environment перед запросами.\n\n## Эндпоинты (16)\n| Method | Path | Auth | Роль |\n|--------|------|------|------|\n| GET | /health | — | — |\n| GET | /health/ready | — | — |\n| POST | /auth/register | — | — |\n| POST | /auth/login | — | — |\n| POST | /auth/refresh | cookie mentorix_refresh | — |\n| POST | /auth/logout | cookie mentorix_refresh | — |\n| GET | /auth/me | Bearer | — |\n| POST | /auth/logout-all | Bearer | — |\n| POST | /admin/users/:user_id/roles/admin | Bearer | trainer, admin (MVP) |\n| GET | /exercises | Bearer | trainer, admin |\n| GET | /exercises/:id | Bearer | trainer, admin |\n| POST | /exercises | Bearer | admin |\n| PUT | /exercises/:id | Bearer | admin |\n| DELETE | /exercises/:id | Bearer | admin |\n| DELETE | /exercises/all | Bearer | admin |\n\nRegister создаёт пользователя с ролью trainer.\n\n## URL\nВсе URL — строки `{{base_url}}/path`. Query-параметры в строке URL (Postman надёжно подставляет переменные).\n\n## Порядок smoke-теста\n1. Health → Ready\n2. Login (или Register)\n3. Me\n4. Grant Admin (optional)\n5. List Exercises",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "if (!pm.environment.name) {",
          "    throw new Error('Выбери environment: Mentorix Local или Mentorix Render Dev');",
          "}",
          "const base = pm.environment.get('base_url');",
          "if (!base) {",
          "    throw new Error('base_url не задан в environment');",
          "}",
          "if (base.endsWith('/')) {",
          "    pm.environment.set('base_url', base.replace(/\\/+$/, ''));",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /health",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/health",
            "description": "Source: `cmd/api/main.go`\n\n200: `{\"status\":\"ok\"}`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /health/ready",
          "request": {
